{
 "title": "What If You Could Read Minds?",
 "duration": 203.5,
 "shots": [
  {
   "id": "s001",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.58,
   "line": "The alley. The stranger. The dog.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s002",
   "start": 2.58,
   "end": 6.84,
   "line": "And you, standing there in your sunglasses, trying very hard not to panic.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s003",
   "start": 6.84,
   "end": 11.78,
   "line": "Don't think about the toothbrush, you tell yourself. Don't think about the toothbrush. The stranger tilts their head.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s004",
   "start": 11.78,
   "end": 17.62,
   "line": "Toothbrush? Your stomach drops. They can hear you. Every thought. Relax, they say.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s005",
   "start": 17.62,
   "end": 19.18,
   "line": "I'm not here to hurt you.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s006",
   "start": 19.18,
   "end": 23.76,
   "line": "I just wanted to see if you'd follow me. You did. So what if you could read minds?",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s007",
   "start": 23.76,
   "end": 27.12,
   "line": "Not guess. Actually hear what people think.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s008",
   "start": 27.12,
   "end": 29.28,
   "line": "Here's what you'd be listening to.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s009",
   "start": 29.28,
   "end": 33.74,
   "line": "Your brain has about eighty-six billion nerve cells, called neurons.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s010",
   "start": 33.74,
   "end": 38.68,
   "line": "Every thought you have is millions of them firing tiny electrical pulses.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s011",
   "start": 38.68,
   "end": 40.6,
   "line": "Sounds loud. It isn't.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s012",
   "start": 40.6,
   "end": 43.5,
   "line": "By the time those signals reach the outside of your skull,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s013",
   "start": 43.5,
   "end": 46.14,
   "line": "they're about fifty millionths of a volt.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s014",
   "start": 46.14,
   "end": 49.24,
   "line": "The magnetic field your brain makes is weaker still.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s015",
   "start": 49.24,
   "end": 52.96,
   "line": "One researcher puts it at more than a billion times weaker than the Earth's.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s016",
   "start": 52.96,
   "end": 54.0,
   "line": "To measure it,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s017",
   "start": 54.0,
   "end": 58.72,
   "line": "scientists use super-cold sensors inside rooms shielded from the outside world.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s018",
   "start": 58.72,
   "end": 60.92,
   "line": "A passing car can drown it out.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s019",
   "start": 60.92,
   "end": 63.32,
   "line": "So hearing thoughts from across a street?",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s020",
   "start": 63.32,
   "end": 68.1,
   "line": "With known physics, that's impossible. But the stranger can.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s021",
   "start": 68.1,
   "end": 69.56,
   "line": "And they tell you what it's like.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s022",
   "start": 69.56,
   "end": 71.6,
   "line": "Imagine a crowded market, they say.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s023",
   "start": 71.6,
   "end": 76.04,
   "line": "Now imagine hearing every single person, all at once. Did I leave the oven on.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s024",
   "start": 76.04,
   "end": 80.02,
   "line": "I hate this song. Is that dog looking at me. It never stops.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s025",
   "start": 80.02,
   "end": 82.28,
   "line": "That's why I like alleys.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s026",
   "start": 82.28,
   "end": 84.68,
   "line": "And here's the strange part.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s027",
   "start": 84.68,
   "end": 87.34,
   "line": "Scientists are starting to do a tiny version of it.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s028",
   "start": 87.34,
   "end": 91.6,
   "line": "In 2023, a team at the University of Texas put people inside a brain scanner",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s029",
   "start": 91.6,
   "end": 93.5,
   "line": "while they listened to podcasts.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s030",
   "start": 93.5,
   "end": 95.66,
   "line": "For about sixteen hours each.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s031",
   "start": 95.66,
   "end": 98.94,
   "line": "A computer learned which brain patterns went with which ideas.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s032",
   "start": 98.94,
   "end": 103.66,
   "line": "Then, when people imagined telling a story, it turned their brain activity into text.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s033",
   "start": 103.66,
   "end": 106.52,
   "line": "Not word for word. It got the gist.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s034",
   "start": 106.52,
   "end": 108.58,
   "line": "But it only worked on the person it was trained on.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s035",
   "start": 108.58,
   "end": 113.82,
   "line": "And people could block it, just by counting, or by thinking about animals.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s036",
   "start": 113.82,
   "end": 114.9,
   "line": "So you try it.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s037",
   "start": 114.9,
   "end": 119.3,
   "line": "You think as hard as you can. Penguin. Giraffe. Hamster. Penguin.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s038",
   "start": 119.3,
   "end": 124.96,
   "line": "The stranger winces. Okay, okay. Stop. That's so annoying. It works on them too.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s039",
   "start": 124.96,
   "end": 128.08,
   "line": "Brain implants go even further. In 2023,",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s040",
   "start": 128.08,
   "end": 132.92,
   "line": "doctors in San Francisco placed a thin sheet of sensors on the brain of a woman named Ann.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s041",
   "start": 132.92,
   "end": 135.92,
   "line": "A stroke had left her unable to speak for eighteen years.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s042",
   "start": 135.92,
   "end": 139.96,
   "line": "The sensors picked up the signals for the sounds she was trying to make.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s043",
   "start": 139.96,
   "end": 144.06,
   "line": "A computer turned them into words, spoken by an avatar on a screen.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s044",
   "start": 144.06,
   "end": 145.8,
   "line": "About seventy-eight words a minute.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s045",
   "start": 145.8,
   "end": 147.96,
   "line": "Normal conversation is about a hundred and sixty.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s046",
   "start": 147.96,
   "end": 150.46,
   "line": "But for Ann, it was a voice again.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s047",
   "start": 150.46,
   "end": 154.04,
   "line": "And in 2024, the first person with a Neuralink implant moved a cursor",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s048",
   "start": 154.04,
   "end": 158.32,
   "line": "and played chess on a laptop, just by thinking.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s049",
   "start": 158.32,
   "end": 160.44,
   "line": "The stranger lowers their hood.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s050",
   "start": 160.44,
   "end": 163.04,
   "line": "My name is Kai, they say.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s051",
   "start": 163.04,
   "end": 165.34,
   "line": "And I'm not the only one.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s052",
   "start": 165.34,
   "end": 169.46,
   "line": "Behind them, on the rooftops, four shapes are watching.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s053",
   "start": 169.46,
   "end": 172.66,
   "line": "We sent you the message after the lake, Kai says.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s054",
   "start": 172.66,
   "end": 177.14,
   "line": "We saw what you did under the ice. In the gym. At the crossing.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s055",
   "start": 177.14,
   "end": 178.88,
   "line": "There are more of us.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s056",
   "start": 178.88,
   "end": 182.42,
   "line": "And something's coming that we can't handle on our own. Tomorrow.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s057",
   "start": 182.42,
   "end": 184.24,
   "line": "Six a.m.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s058",
   "start": 184.24,
   "end": 185.7,
   "line": "The old observatory on the hill.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s059",
   "start": 185.7,
   "end": 191.8,
   "line": "Then Kai smiles. And stop thinking about penguins. It's distracting.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s060",
   "start": 191.8,
   "end": 195.96,
   "line": "So if you could read one person's mind, whose would it be? Tell us in the comments.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s061",
   "start": 195.96,
   "end": 199.86,
   "line": "And subscribe, because next time, you meet the others.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "s062",
   "start": 199.86,
   "end": 203.5,
   "line": "Starting with the one who can fly.",
   "set": null,
   "scene": "TODO",
   "footnote": "",
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": ""
  }
 ],
 "music": []
}